            <common:generalComment xml:lang="en">The multioutput-process 'mining, gravel / sand' delivers the co-products 'sand, at mine' and 'gravel, round, at mine'. The typical production mix in Switzerland is: sand 35% and round gravel 65%. From the total sectoral production volume (100%) of mined gravel round, crushed and sand, about 85% is gravel round and sand.  ;
UUID: e13183f8-d825-3264-87d6-e66f9750f908</common:generalComment>
